    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>WISHLIST NOW COMRADE, THATS AN ORDER!!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Propaganda vs. Zombies</strong> is a bullet heaven deck builder where you can't move! Resources are scarce and your main goal will be to convert all these zombies into Comrades with the use of Propaganda!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/1890911cff5a8c2b633a316e8efe0f94.poster.avif?t=1748354913\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/1890911cff5a8c2b633a316e8efe0f94.webm?t=1748354913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Fight the Undead</strong>: Use carefully curated cards to shoot, zap, and crush the zombie menace before they overrun your borders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Summon Comrades</strong>: Use Propaganda Bullets (trademark pending) to convert zombies into Comrades that will spread the good word of our nation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Strategic Deckbuilding:\u00a0</strong>Build a deck to suit your playstyle. Whether you prefer overwhelming firepower, cunning spell combos, or comrade-based tactics, there\u2019s always a new strategy to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/cfc6c1d23029b81de2eaba5e6865f21a.poster.avif?t=1748354913\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/cfc6c1d23029b81de2eaba5e6865f21a.webm?t=1748354913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Shape Your Path</strong>: Make critical resource choices that open new opportunities or impose new challenges. These decisions affect your progression and can completely alter how each run unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/154d2bf8d156d1179a34785834c1b760.poster.avif?t=1748354913\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/154d2bf8d156d1179a34785834c1b760.webm?t=1748354913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/154d2bf8d156d1179a34785834c1b760.mp4?t=1748354913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Roguelite Progression :</strong>Each run is unique. Randomized cards, unpredictable enemies, and different resource decisions ensure no two playthroughs are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you answer the call to defend Hibura, or will the zombie hordes consume your country\u2019s hopes of a bright red future? Join the revolution\u2014<strong>Propaganda vs. Zombies</strong> awaits!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>WISHLIST NOW COMRADE, THATS AN ORDER!!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Propaganda vs. Zombies</strong> is a bullet heaven deck builder where you can't move! Resources are scarce and your main goal will be to convert all these zombies into Comrades with the use of Propaganda!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/1890911cff5a8c2b633a316e8efe0f94.poster.avif?t=1748354913\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/1890911cff5a8c2b633a316e8efe0f94.webm?t=1748354913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Fight the Undead</strong>: Use carefully curated cards to shoot, zap, and crush the zombie menace before they overrun your borders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Summon Comrades</strong>: Use Propaganda Bullets (trademark pending) to convert zombies into Comrades that will spread the good word of our nation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Strategic Deckbuilding:\u00a0</strong>Build a deck to suit your playstyle. Whether you prefer overwhelming firepower, cunning spell combos, or comrade-based tactics, there\u2019s always a new strategy to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/cfc6c1d23029b81de2eaba5e6865f21a.poster.avif?t=1748354913\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/cfc6c1d23029b81de2eaba5e6865f21a.webm?t=1748354913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Shape Your Path</strong>: Make critical resource choices that open new opportunities or impose new challenges. These decisions affect your progression and can completely alter how each run unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/154d2bf8d156d1179a34785834c1b760.poster.avif?t=1748354913\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/154d2bf8d156d1179a34785834c1b760.webm?t=1748354913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/154d2bf8d156d1179a34785834c1b760.mp4?t=1748354913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Roguelite Progression :</strong>Each run is unique. Randomized cards, unpredictable enemies, and different resource decisions ensure no two playthroughs are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you answer the call to defend Hibura, or will the zombie hordes consume your country\u2019s hopes of a bright red future? Join the revolution\u2014<strong>Propaganda vs. Zombies</strong> awaits!</p>",
    "short_description": "Build your deck of Propaganda, Bullets, and Spells to defend your Leader in this Bullet Heaven where you can't move! Use Propaganda to turn Zombies into your Comrades and make them fight for You! Make choices about your people but be careful, they might overthrow you if you choose wrong!",
